# Client-confidential: product strategy doc stays local (see docs/README.md)
docs/PRD.md

# Instruction and config files for other AI coding agents. Local tooling, not a
# repository contract — `CLAUDE.md` and `docs/` are the shared ones.
# Anchored to the repository root: unanchored, `AGENTS.md` would also swallow a
# `docs/AGENTS.md` someone later writes as a shared, tool-neutral pointer, and
# `git add` on it would silently do nothing.
/AGENTS.md
/.agents/
/.codex/
